{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-red-crystal-pearls-100g-sold-by-easy-florist-supplies-2601-0349","content_id":"42490cb3-4d0b-439c-8594-099ce54a1a11","description":"Product Safety Report for Red Crystal Pearls presenting a high risk of asphyxiation.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"03674c63-a658-4b3d-b3be-e15b3373ec99","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-02-21T11:29:47+00:00","id":"03674c63-a658-4b3d-b3be-e15b3373ec99","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-02-21T11:29:47+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6999972ba58a315dbe72c0e7/2601-0349-product-safety-report-red-crystal-pearls.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Red Crystal Pearls 100g sold by Easy Florist Supplies</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a high risk of asphyxiation, as it can block a young child’s airway if swallowed in its hydrated form.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action:  The product is no longer available for sale.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Decorative articles/Homeware/Gardenware - Flower/Plant Pots Replacement Parts/Accessories</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product ID</td>\n      <td>FL3076 Red</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>5055141691544</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Unknown</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Red water beads described on the packaging as ‘crystal pearls’.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_03674c63-a658-4b3d-b3be-e15b3373ec99\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6999972ba58a315dbe72c0e7/2601-0349-product-safety-report-red-crystal-pearls.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a high risk of asphyxiation. If the product is swallowed in its hydrated form, it can block a young child’s airway. </p>\n\n<p>OPSS has published a Product Safety Alert for water beads, which can be accessed at: <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-alert-water-beads-psa7.\">https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-alert-water-beads-psa7.</a></p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product is no longer available for sale.</p>\n\n<p>Owners are advised to stop using the product and keep it out of the reach of young children. Contact the distributor you purchased from to request redress.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2601-0349</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-21T11:30:04Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"household-decorative-articles","product_measure_type":["warning-consumers-of-risks"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-02-21","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-02-21T11:30:04+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/pro